The setCookie() affects the Context object. The Context object holds the headers information and returns a Response object with the those headers when c.text() or c.json() is called. That is why Context exists.
On the other hand, new Response() is a low-layer API for Hono; it has nothing to do with Context.
Response - Web API | MDN
So please use c.text() or c.json().
